Subject: [PATCH] Drop SimpleOpenGL3App include from Wavefront2GLInstanceGraphicsShape

Wavefront2GLInstanceGraphicsShape.cpp is pure data conversion (Wavefront
OBJ to a vertex/index struct) — it has no OpenGL dependency of its own.
But it #include's SimpleOpenGL3App.h, which transitively pulls in real GL
headers that Emscripten doesn't have. The only thing actually used from
that chain is b3Max, which lives in Bullet3Common/b3MinMax.h, so swap the
include for the narrow header.
---
 examples/Importers/ImportObjDemo/Wavefront2GLInstanceGraphicsShape.cpp | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/examples/Importers/ImportObjDemo/Wavefront2GLInstanceGraphicsShape.cpp b/examples/Importers/ImportObjDemo/Wavefront2GLInstanceGraphicsShape.cpp
--- a/examples/Importers/ImportObjDemo/Wavefront2GLInstanceGraphicsShape.cpp
+++ b/examples/Importers/ImportObjDemo/Wavefront2GLInstanceGraphicsShape.cpp
@@ -4,7 +4,8 @@
 #include "../../OpenGLWindow/GLInstanceGraphicsShape.h"
 //#include "btBulletDynamicsCommon.h"
 #include "LinearMath/btVector3.h"
-#include "../../OpenGLWindow/SimpleOpenGL3App.h"
+// SimpleOpenGL3App include removed (unused; pulls in GL).
+#include "Bullet3Common/b3MinMax.h"
 #include "Wavefront2GLInstanceGraphicsShape.h"
 #include "../../OpenGLWindow/GLInstancingRenderer.h"
 #include "../../OpenGLWindow/GLInstanceGraphicsShape.h"
